# .agent Completeness

`.agent` must remain a standalone project briefing.

A new agent reading ONLY `.agent` must understand:

- what EventHub Web App is
- how to run it
- what backend it consumes
- required environment variables
- X-API-Key authentication
- participant vs organizer token separation
- the route inventory
- which screens still use mock data
- which modules use real APIs
- the Lovable UI preservation rule
- known backend contracts
- known gotchas
- what changed most recently

Do not write vague entries such as:

- fixed stuff
- updated page
- added API

Describe concrete behavior and files.

Change Log entries do not replace updates to living sections.
